..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SYSTEM.BSTART.BN
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Funktion       : Uebergibt die Eingabeparameter an das FOP und startet dieses.
.. Functionality  : Passes the input parameters to the fop and starts it.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Declarations
.type text xcommand
.type bool xpassword xbackground
.type DVM2 xstdout xstderr
.type integer  xerrorno
..
.. Initializations
.copy U|xcommand = M|command
.copy U|xpassword = M|onetimepassword
.copy U|xbackground = M|background
.copy U|xerrorno = M|errornumber
.copy U|xstdout = M|standardout ? _M|nostdout
.copy U|xstderr = M|standarderr ? _M|nostderr
..
.input "is/FO.SYSTEM"
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
